%% aoneahsan-cccs-react-forms — full flow
flowchart TD
    trigger([Building or touching a form]) --> existing{What is it using now?}
    existing -->|useState or Formik| migrate[Migrate to RHF + Zod NOW —<br/>a mixed codebase is worse<br/>than either choice alone]
    existing -->|RHF + Zod| schema
    migrate --> schema

    schema[Write the Zod schema FIRST]
    schema --> derive["type FormData = z.infer typeof schema<br/>NEVER hand-write it — it will drift"]
    derive --> copy[Error messages go IN the schema,<br/>phrased for a reader:<br/>'Enter a valid email address']
    copy --> resolver[useForm with zodResolver]

    resolver --> fields[Render fields via the shared<br/>form-field wrappers]
    fields --> required{Is this field required?}
    required -->|yes| blocks[It may block submit]
    required -->|no| never[It must NEVER block submit.<br/>Optional-blocking is a bug]

    blocks --> submitbtn
    never --> submitbtn
    submitbtn{Disabling the submit button?}
    submitbtn -->|on !isValid| wrong[WRONG. Let submit run, show errors,<br/>focus the first one.<br/>A dead button explains nothing]
    submitbtn -->|on isSubmitting| right[Correct — prevents double submission]
    wrong --> right

    right --> steps{Multi-step form?}
    steps -->|yes| urlstep["Step lives in a URL query param.<br/>Validate the step with trigger fields<br/>before advancing"]
    steps -->|no| onsubmit
    urlstep --> onsubmit

    onsubmit[Submit] --> result{Outcome?}
    result -->|validation failed| showerr[Inline beside the field +<br/>aria-invalid + aria-describedby.<br/>Focus the first invalid field]
    result -->|server rejected| setError["setError field-level if you know<br/>which field, else root.<br/>NOT a toast — the user must correct it"]
    result -->|success| done([Done])
    showerr --> done
    setError --> done

    classDef gateNode fill:#fff4e6,stroke:#d97706,color:#7c2d12
    classDef terminal fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#059669,color:#064e3b
    classDef warn fill:#fef2f2,stroke:#dc2626,color:#7f1d1d
    class existing,required,submitbtn,steps,result gateNode
    class trigger,done terminal
    class wrong,never warn
